/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256657847/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1447378722","hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/384110/45874/d31b2736642a5e7264a3d0159de92c8fcdd5e9a3/1751273913/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1447378722","mp4":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/256657847/movie480.mp4"}],"genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"features":["Single-player","Steam Achievements","Steam Cloud","Steam Trading Cards","Family Sharing"],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"controller":"full","dev":["Ice-Pick Lodge","General Arcade"],"pub":["Good Shepherd Entertainment"],"released":"Oct 29, 2015","meta":76,"langs":["English","Russian","Polish","Italian"],"min":[["OS","Windows XP or Later"],["Processor","AMD Athlon 64 2.3 GHz / Intel Pentium 2.2 GHz"],["Memory","2 GB RAM"],["Graphics","Radeon HD 4890 1024MB / GeForce 210 512MB"],["DirectX","Version 9.0"],["Storage","2 GB available space"]],"rec":[],"deck":3,"blurb":"An unstoppable, deadly plague is wiping out a strange town on the steppe, one that grew up around a huge slaughterhouse and has a peculiar social order that formed across generations. You take control of one of three characters and try to save it. Pathologic Classic HD is a restored edition of the original psychological survival game from Ice-Pick Lodge, played in first person.\n\nExpect an unsettling, oppressive mood rather than a conventional action adventure. Prayer and science have both failed the townspeople, and the story is built around that desperation. It is a single-player game with full controller support. It suits players who want a strange, atmospheric survival experience and are willing to engage with an unusual design."}}